Termul Symbols
==============

TermulSymbols.woff2 in this directory is a modified copy of the Symbols-only
font shipped with Nerd Fonts 3.5.1 (SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.ttf). Nerd Fonts
aggregates glyphs from several icon projects, each under its own license, so the
licenses and attribution notices that apply to the bundled file are collected
here.

Changes made for Termul
-----------------------

* Subset to the code points in the table below. Glyphs outside them were removed.
* Glyphs from the Font Logos set (U+F300 to U+F384) were removed. Nerd Fonts
  records that set as Unlicensed in its license-audit.md, so Termul does not
  redistribute it.
* U+EFCF and U+F385 were removed as well: no upstream glyph set claims either
  code point.
* Units per em changed from 2048 to 1000, advance width from 2048 to 606,
  hhea ascender and descender set to 955 and -245, OS/2 usWinAscent and
  usWinDescent set to 975 and 265. That makes the face metric compatible with
  Paper Mono, which the terminal renders text with.
* Family renamed from "Symbols Nerd Font Mono" to "Termul Symbols", so no
  upstream Reserved Font Name is reused.

The font name table carries the notice "Copyright (c) 2016, Ryan McIntyre",
which is the notice recorded in the upstream Symbols-only font.

Glyph sets included
-------------------

Code point ranges follow the Nerd Fonts wiki page "Glyph Sets and Code Points"
(v3.5.0). Licenses follow the Nerd Fonts license-audit.md glyph and icon source
table, which is the authority upstream publishes for these sets.

  Set                        Code points                  License
  IEC Power Symbols          23FB-23FE, 2B58              MIT
  Powerline Extra            2630, E0A3, E0B4-E0C8, E0CA, MIT
                             E0CC-E0D2, E0D4, E0D6-E0D7
  Octicons                   2665, 26A1, F400-F533        MIT
  Heavy Angle Brackets       276C-2771                    Nerd Fonts project
  Pomicons                   E000-E00A                    SIL OFL 1.1
  Powerline                  E0A0-E0A2, E0B0-E0B3         MIT
  Font Awesome Extension     E200-E2A9                    MIT
  Weather Icons              E300-E3E3                    SIL OFL 1.1
  Seti-UI + Custom           E5FA-E6BB                    MIT
  Devicons                   E700-E958                    MIT
  Codicons                   EA60-EA88, EA8A-EA8C,        CC BY 4.0
                             EA8F-EAC7, EAC9, EACC-EB09,
                             EB0B-EB4E, EB50-EC5E,
                             EC60-EC84
  Progress                   EE00-EE0B                    Nerd Fonts project
  Font Awesome (icons)       ED00-EDFF, EE0C-EFCE,        CC BY 4.0
                             F000-F2FF

The file contains 3593 mapped code points, all of them inside the ranges above.
Sets that upstream records only as Nerd Fonts project glyphs (Heavy Angle
Brackets and Progress) have no separate upstream license entry.

Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 notices
----------------------------------------

Both sets below are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
Termul modified them by recoding the glyphs to the Nerd Fonts private use
areas, subsetting them, and rescaling the outlines to Paper Mono's metrics.

  Codicons, Microsoft Corporation.
  https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons
  Recoded to U+EA60 to U+EC84.

  Font Awesome icons, Fonticons, Inc.
  https://fontawesome.com
  Recoded to U+ED00 to U+EFCE and U+F000 to U+F2FF. The icon artwork is CC BY
  4.0; the Nerd Fonts license audit notes that only the icons are used here.

